      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE HOUSE (1) goes very well here starting 17 times for seven wins and six minors. Comes off a (19.68) win last time, scoring by 0.8 lengths in a Grade 5 over 352m at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. FIRE UP SHAZAM (8) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 21.94 beating Hara's Dolly. Can make it back-to-back wins. SHE PICKED IT (5) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 457m behind So Refined (26.62) in a Restricted WIN. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Deserves plenty of respect. SANDAVE STAPLES (2) is always a threat when she races at this track and distance.",
